 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-12-01",
   "text": "Protecting Communities from Plastics Act\n This bill sets forth a variety of requirements and incentives to reduce the production and use of plastics and other petrochemicals, including by directing the Environmental Protection Agency to place a temporary pause on certain new permits for petrochemical facilities under the Clean Air Act and the Clean Water Act."
  }
